  "description": "The Xion Electric Six-Seater Pedicab is the high-capacity commercial vehicle for operators running large-group transport, resort shuttles, stadium services, and high-volume event contracts.\n\nQuick specs: 6 passengers · 40+ mile range · 72V 58Ah battery · 750W direct-drive transaxle · 2,000 lb payload · commercial duty cycle (300+ days/yr) · American-made frame, assembled in San Diego\n\nSpecs\n\nBuilt for High-Volume Operations\n\nMoving 6 passengers per trip changes the math on every shift. The six-seater is the top choice for stadium egress, resort loops, festival grounds, and corporate campuses — operators running this vehicle alongside smaller units consistently report it as their highest revenue-per-hour asset.\n\nQualifies as a Class 2 e-bike in most U.S. states. Verify local ordinances before deployment — Xion's fleet support team can help.\n\nWhat's Included\n\nShips fully assembled and configured with Chariot app integration. Optional: Canopy, sound system, custom branding wrap, LED lighting package.\n\nFleet pricing and financing available. 2-year frame warranty, 1-year motor & battery warranty.",
